    "id": "31",
    "metadata": {
      "label": "ai",
      "description": "Connects to the remote agent and builds its tool.\n\nThe Agent Card is read once, here. Skills added to the remote agent later are not seen until the toolkit is\ncreated again. A card passed as an `a2a:AgentCard` is used as given and is not fetched again, so a card\nwhose signature you verified stays the card in use. When the card offers an extended Agent Card and a `secret`\nis given, the extended card is read too, and its skills are the ones the tool describes. If it cannot be read,\nthe public card is used.\n",
      "icon": "https://bcentral-packageicons.azureedge.net/images/ballerina_ai_1.18.0.png"
    },
    "codedata": {
      "node": "A2A_TOOL_KIT",
